{"reviewId": "14755045_86xWDYXDa", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "周金涛的研究发现，如果把观察期缩短到几年尺度，能源消费的增速会呈现出 ​​9—10 年左右的朱格拉周期波动​​。也就是说，能源需求的扩张与收缩大致遵循设备投资带动的中周期节奏。\n由于能源价格对需求变化十分敏感，当经济处于朱格拉周期的扩张阶段时，能源消费增速上升，推动能源价格上涨；反之，当经济进入萧条阶段，能源消费放缓，能源价格也随之走低。\n因此，在短期尺度上，能源价格的波动与经济增长率保持同步——经济增长率高时能源价格易涨，增长率低时能源价格易跌。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "对短期的能源波动分析后我们发现，能源消费增速遵从朱格拉周期，所以短期的能源价格波动是与经济增长率相关的", "range": "15674-15725", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "14755045_86xWDYXDa", "userVid": 14755045, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769778667, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 14755045, "name": "宣竞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eribDf5WbXhckyg2M2mb40M8BxVy6hmycicsKI8utaeYLiaNlHia20fGHzF0Pw2hsibrvZQ0k3rzHMaKjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "仁者如射，射者正己而后发；发而不中，不怨胜己者，反求诸己而已", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 356060382, "name": "JMc", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/nibb7W6bx5xlZ2icVXVXicJj9RicV74icH1eicaRM15hzLvGcGswPZJByOjQhpO2wSXxepluM4EQ8WIzXW91y0foViaxfhic6syL1vhWbRPBVndy7HE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}], "